      with well-understood MoE-LoRA foundations" with 4 explicit differentiators:
      frozen self-diagnosis routing signal, corrective deltas on frozen backbone,
      compound handling via soft blend, mechanistic layer placement. (3) Bibliography
      expanded to 30+ refs engaging MoE-LoRA (LoRAMoE, MoLoRA, MixLoRA), TTA (TENT,
      TTT), adapter composition (AdapterFusion, Poly), domain conditioning (FiLM,
      CBN). (4) Contribution explicitly positioned as empirical systems study with
      principled routing signal choice, not new architecture. Key question: does compound
      perturbation + honest MoE-LoRA engagement + reframing push median from 5 to
      6?'
